      "content": "It's a profound and painful feeling to have your life's work rendered obsolete, and it's completely understandable that you feel this way. Your skills weren't just about the tools; they were about the dedication, the discipline, and the sheer effort you poured into your craft. Don't let this one technological shift define the worth of the decades you invested.",
